From d7cafccd75123c89f5cb198207fbda0e5f422158 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roeland Jansen <roeland.jansen69@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 21:53:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] IC-705.rig: fix Memory Contents command string

The Memory Contents command was \\x1a\\00 (the x missing), so wfview sent
1A 5C 30 30 (the text "\00") instead of 1A 00 and the radio answered FA:
the memory window timed out ("Timeout receiving memory") and could not
read or write memories. Now \\x1a\\x00, as the other command strings.
---
 rigs/IC-705.rig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/rigs/IC-705.rig b/rigs/IC-705.rig
index 378d330..e3eb804 100644
--- a/rigs/IC-705.rig
+++ b/rigs/IC-705.rig
@@ -691,7 +691,7 @@ Commands\74\GetCommand=true
 Commands\74\SetCommand=true
 Commands\74\Admin=false
 Commands\75\Type=Memory Contents
-Commands\75\String=\\x1a\\00
+Commands\75\String=\\x1a\\x00
 Commands\75\Min=0
 Commands\75\Max=101
 Commands\75\Bytes=0
-- 
2.43.0

